## Five identical causal branch orders

| Role and active source | Helper | Primitive membership | Mapping membership | Sequence membership | Cold policy/reuse comparison |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| controller `src/bu/experiments/week8_exp2a_recovery.py` |916|920|928|932|1114/1147|
| entrypoint `scripts/week8_exp2a_recovery_entrypoint.py` |254|258|266|270|428/460|
| fit child `scripts/week8_exp2a_recovery_fit_child.py` |734|738|746|750|908/940|
| inspector `scripts/week8_exp2a_recovery_inspector.py` |382|386|394|398|556/588|
| worker `scripts/week8_exp2a_recovery_worker.py` |1142|1146|1154|1158|1318/1350|

All paths are below `raw-consumer-binding-integration-prep004`. Each starts with kind=type(value), then primitive `kind in (bool,int,float,str)`, exact bytes, historical Path isinstance, exact Pattern, Mapping membership, sequence membership and set-sort membership. Only the Mapping predicate and trusted import differ from its Source003/pin-only helper AST; mapping recursion and other definitions remain AST-exact. Full source hashes and exact segments are in the JSON report.

